---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="About Abhishek — data analyst and AI builder."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<p>
				I'm Abhishek. Over the past 6.5+ years, I've worked across
				ad-tech, ed-tech, and digital commerce — currently as a Senior
				Data Analyst focused on revenue analytics and data governance.
			</p>
			<p>
				My work sits at a specific intersection: making sure the numbers
				a business relies on are actually correct, and then turning
				those numbers into forecasts and decisions people can act on.
				I've built pipeline forecasting models, KPI governance
				frameworks, and single-source-of-truth systems that catch data
				errors before they become expensive mistakes.
			</p>
			<p>
				More recently, I've been applying that same rigor to AI —
				building lightweight tools and agents that solve real, narrow
				problems instead of chasing hype. This site is where that work
				lives: case studies, a running blog on data and AI in practice,
				and free tools you can use directly.
			</p>
			<p>
				When I'm not deep in a dataset, I'm usually behind a camera — I
				run a mobile photography page, <a
					href="https://instagram.com/the_photographwala"
					>the_photographwala</a
				>, on the side.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
